{"repositoryId":1188643799,"availability":"available","full":"Neel-Parghi/GymForge","name":"GymForge","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"C#","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-03-22T11:37:04Z","updated":"2026-10-12T03:32:39Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://elevatyon.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://elevatyon.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:28.230Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:28.230Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:28.230Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T11:46:28.230Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Elevatyon is a multi-tenant SaaS platform for gym owners, trainers, and members - one system to run a gym's day-to-day operations (memberships, billing, staff payroll, attendance) and give members a real fitness experience (workout & diet planning, progress tracking, nutrition logging).","It's built as a monorepo: an Angular web app, a .NET Web API, and a static marketing landing page."],"features":["Member management - onboarding, subscriptions, plan assignment, attendance, and a self-service member portal with automatic email-based account linking (a member can be added by staff before they ever sign up).","Billing - two independent billing flows: Elevatyon's own SaaS subscription for the gym owner (Razorpay checkout, trial periods, automatic access cutoff on expiry) and the gym's own member billing (plans with promotional…","Staff & payroll - role-based staff accounts (Trainer / Staff) with invite-based onboarding, a configurable permission matrix for what Staff can see, PT/Rehab commission tracking, and trainer-linked custom invoices.","Workout & Diet libraries - trainers build reusable Daily/Weekly/Split workout templates and diet plans with calorie/macro targets; gym owners can view, edit, and assign any trainer's plans to any member from a dedicated…","Multi-branch support, gym announcements, and an inventory/equipment tracker."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Neel-Parghi/GymForge/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"6aad23fccc00bcea9987b0ee48f54ba721e1ae4df1401e2cea7070e44ca42e69","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:28.474Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:28.474Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Elevatyon is a multi-tenant SaaS platform for gym owners, trainers, and members - one system to run a gym's day-to-day operations (memberships, billing, staff payroll, attendance) and give members a real fitness experience (workout & diet planning, progress tracking, nutrition logging).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Neel-Parghi/GymForge/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Log in with either of these accounts to explore the product without signing up:","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Neel-Parghi/GymForge/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Member management - onboarding, subscriptions, plan assignment, attendance, and a self-service member portal with automatic email-based account linking (a member can be added by staff before they ever sign up).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Neel-Parghi/GymForge/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"optional","text":"If you want to understand why something works the way it does (not just what the code does), start with docs/business-logic/ - it covers the roles/permissions model, the subscription & billing rules, workout/diet plan semantics, and onboarding/invitation flow in plain English.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Neel-Parghi/GymForge/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"6aad23fccc00bcea9987b0ee48f54ba721e1ae4df1401e2cea7070e44ca42e69","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Neel-Parghi/GymForge/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:28.474Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-12T03:32:39Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Ne